<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON FIFTH DAY ORDER OF PLAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON FIFTH DAY ORDER OF PLAY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Order of play for matches on the</p>
<p>top courts on Friday, the fifth day of Wimbledon (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding)</p>
<p>Centre court (starts 1100GMT)</p>
<p>Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) v Elena Likhovtseva (Russia)</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v Olga Barabanshchkova (Belarus)</p>
<p>14-Tim Henman (Britain) v Jerome Golmard (France)</p>
<p> 8-Boris Becker (Germany) v Thomas Johansson (Sweden)	</p>
<p>Court One (starts 1100GMT)</p>
<p>Venus Williams U.S. v Magdalena Grzybowska (Poland)</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) v Jonathan Stark (U.S.)</p>
<p>14-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) v Amy Frazier (U.S.)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany)</p>
<p>Court Two (starts 1000GMT)</p>
<p>9-Mary Pierce (U.S.) v Dominique van Roost (Belgium)</p>
<p>11-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) v Noelle van Lottum (France)</p>
<p>4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) v Andrei Pavel (Romania)</p>
<p>12-Pat Rafter (Australia) v Jens Knippschild (Germany)</p>
<p>Court Three (starts 1000GMT)</p>
<p>Larisa Neiland (Latvia) v Naoko Kijimuta (Japan)</p>
<p>Samantha Smith (Britain) v Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan)</p>
<p>2-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) v Magnus Norman (Sweden)</p>
<p>4-Iva Majoli (Croatia) v Marion Maruska (Austria)</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) v Michael Tebbutt (Australia) or</p>
<p>Javier Sanchez (Spain)</p>
</text>
